        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 0 for SLE 15 SP7)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150700_51 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-38664: ice: Fix a null pointer dereference in ice_copy_and_init_pkg() (bsc#1248631).\n- CVE-2025-38511: drm/xe/pf: Clear all LMTT pages on alloc (bsc#1248176).\n- CVE-2025-38617: net/packet: fix a race in packet_set_ring() and packet_notifier() (bsc#1249208).\n- CVE-2025-38453: kABI: io_uring: msg_ring ensure io_kiocb freeing is deferred (bsc#1247737).\n- CVE-2025-38618: vsock: Do not allow binding to VMADDR_PORT_ANY (bsc#1249207).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
